WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:04.145
With clear names, the code reads like a sentence.

2
00:04.145 --> 00:11.409
Names with several words are written in lowerCamelCase: the first word in lowercase, every next word with a capital.

3
00:11.409 --> 00:18.819
In C# you use PascalCase for methods and properties. In JavaScript you write almost everything in lowerCamelCase.
